# HTML standards

- Files live in `pages/` — one file per route.
- Mandatory `<!-- @file ... -->` header as first lines.
- Semantic landmarks; one `<h1>` per page; `<html lang="fr">`.
- No inline `<script>` or `<style>`.
- Hook TS with `data-*` (English kebab-case): `data-hero-reveal`, etc.
- Critical content in HTML (not canvas) for SEO and accessibility.
- Real `<a href>` links; complete meta + Open Graph per page.
